# Tikram Arabia (tekramWebsite)

## Stack (do not change)
- Marketing site is **React.js (Vite SPA)** on the existing **PERN** stack (PostgreSQL, Express, React, Node).
- **SSR / Next.js / prerender / separate mobile stack are REJECTED.** Do not migrate the framework.
- Route-level lazy loading crashed production when a chunk had an **undefined default export** (React #306). Use `lazyNamed()` in `website/src/utils/lazyNamed.js` only — it requires a real named function export. Do **not** add Vite `manualChunks`.
- Mobile homepage hero stays in HTML `#boot-shell` (do not tear it down). React Header + below-fold sections mount immediately; React `HeroSection` is desktop-only. Cookie bar is in the first HTML on phones. Do **not** delay content with timers.
- Below-fold Home sections, other pages, Footer, CTA, cookie banner, and AOS are named-export chunks that load immediately via Suspense. Particles stay off below 768px. App CSS is async.

## Domains & deploy
- Site: `tikramarabia.com` (VPS `/opt/tikramarabia`, Docker `-p tikramarabia`)
- API: `api.tikramarabia.com` | Dashboard: `dashboard.tikramarabia.com`
- Auto-deploy: GitHub self-hosted runner `tikram-vps` on push to `main`
- Manual: `cd /opt/tikramarabia && bash deploy/scripts/deploy.sh`
- After Mafateeh nginx recreate → `deploy/scripts/sync-tikram-nginx.sh`
- Frontend env: `VITE_SITE_URL`, optional `VITE_GA4_MEASUREMENT_ID` (build-time). Do not invent a GA4 ID.

## Production vs repo (23 Aug 2026)
- **Repo + local `npm run build` / Vite preview: SEO fixes VERIFIED** (robots.txt text/plain, sitemap.xml, manifest, favicon.ico, logo-02.webp, canonical/OG/JSON-LD, /ar routes).
- **Live tikramarabia.com still serves the old ~967-byte SPA shell** (Last-Modified 20 Aug 2026). robots.txt / sitemap.xml / wp-admin still return HTML until deploy.
- HTTP→HTTPS 301 is live. www→apex is in `deploy/nginx/templates/tikramarabia.conf` but not applied on the live reverse-proxy yet.

## Language routing
- English is unprefixed. Arabic is `/ar` and `/ar/...`.
- `LanguageProvider` + index.html inline script set `lang` / `dir` from the URL.
- Use `LocalizedLink` / `localizedPath`. `/blog` redirects to `/blogs`.

## SEO implementation (keep working)
- `public/robots.txt`, `public/sitemap.xml` (generated by `scripts/generate-sitemap.mjs`), `public/site.webmanifest`
- `public/favicon.ico` + `public/logo-02.webp` (~27KB). Header light logo uses `/logo-02.webp`; dark/menu still use the white PNG.
- `SeoHead` / `SeoManager` / `jsonLd.js` — canonical, hreflang, OG/Twitter, Organization + WebSite + BlogPosting
- Cookie consent (`tikram-arabia-cookie-consent`) gates GA4
- `/accessibility` EN+AR, footer link
- website nginx: security headers, hashed-asset cache, HTML no-cache, probe 404s (`wp-admin`, `.env`, `phpmyadmin`)
- `optimizeMediaUrl()` rewrites Cloudinary `/upload/` URLs with `f_auto,q_auto,w_*`. Do not change CMS folder names in code.

