## Stability rules
- Decorative hand is CSS background and **hidden below `md`** so it cannot be mobile LCP.
- AOS is dynamically imported and disabled below 1024px.
- Do not self-host fonts unless explicitly asked (typography risk).
- Do not enable the homepage Portfolio section without a business decision.
- Do not write T&C or fake social/GA4 values.
